{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
CloudBSD DRM core (%%PORTNAME%%) provides drm/ttm/dmabuf for %%OPSYS%% %%OSREL%%.

Install vendor modules separately, or the full set via:
  pkg install cloudbsd-drm-66-kmod
  # or umbrella: cloudbsd-drm-kmod

For GPU detection hints:
  cloudbsd-gpu-detect   (sysutils/cloudbsd-gpu-autoload)

Users needing graphics should be in the "video" group.

Rebuild from ports if this package was not built for your running kernel.
EOM
}
